# F1-76 inputs for Listing 1 (U-MCU-1 PWM timer model)
# a tiny case you can check by hand: 1 MHz timer clock, no prescaler, ARR = 9, CCR = 3
show tiny 1000000 0 9 3
# CCR = 0 and CCR > ARR: the two ends of the duty range
show always-low 1000000 0 9 0
show always-high 1000000 0 9 12
# an LED dimmer: 1 kHz, 25 % from a 72 MHz timer clock
solve led-dimmer 72000000 1000 25
# a hobby-servo style signal: 50 Hz with a 1.5 ms pulse (7.5 %)
solve servo 72000000 50 7.5
